  /// The rendered app tree once the boot is trusted (gh-1336): a spinner
  /// until the first render lands, then the JSON widget tree — extracted
  /// from [_buildBody] so each half stays under the CRAP ratchet (the
  /// native-bridge tests that cover these lines skip on hosted Linux, so
